OL,3,GNEWSAMan reunited with missing letter
OL,4,Aposted 54 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man said he was blown away after
OL,7,Fbeing reunited with a letter he posted
OL,8,Fmore than 50 years ago, finding it
OL,9,Fframed on the wall of a pub.
OL,11,FRennie Chivers, from Essex, posted a
OL,12,Fcollectable envelope to himself in
OL,13,F1972, with first-issue stamps
OL,14,Fcommemorating the silver wedding
OL,15,Fanniversary of the late Queen Elizabeth
OL,16,FII and the Duke of Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
