OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan reunited with missing letter
OL,4,Aposted 54 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe assumed it had been lost over time,
OL,7,Fbut on the same date 54 years later, he
OL,8,Fwas astonished to find it in the Red
OL,9,FLion in Thorrington, near Colchester,
OL,10,Fwith the words "still waiting for
OL,11,FRennie" written underneath.
OL,13,F"It was absolutely crystal clear to me
OL,14,Fthat it was the envelope I posted back
OL,15,Fin 1972. I just couldn't believe it,"
OL,16,Fhe told the BBC.
